    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "The assertion is framed as absence of evidence over all development.", "The rival 'unknown vital agency' has no measurable definition.";
